      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pj",
          "text": "Whiplash.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pk",
          "text": " ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pm",
          "text": "Whiplash",
          "marks": [
            "l8pl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pn",
          "text": " is a neck injury caused by a sudden back-and-forth whip-like movement of the head and neck. It can damage muscles, discs, nerves, and tendons in the neck and spine.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8pr",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pp",
          "text": "Spinal cord injury.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pq",
          "text": " Spinal cord injuries can cause permanent paralysis.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8pu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ps",
          "text": "Back injury.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pt",
          "text": " A back injury to the tendons, ligaments, or muscles may cause severe lower back pain, spinal disc ruptures, or compression. This leaves victims with pain, tingling, numbness, and weakness that can radiate to their legs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8px",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pv",
          "text": "Vital organ damage.",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8pw",
          "text": " Vital organ damage, like extensive internal bleeding, can cause shock and result in death.",
